# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We use the Ising model on a line of 10 sites:\n"
msgstr "Folosim modelul Ising pe o linie de 10 site-uri:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{9} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + \\sum_{i=1}^{10} h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{9} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + \\sum_{i=1}^{10} h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $J$ is the coupling strength between two sites and $h$ is the external magnetic field.\n"
"The [qiskit_addon_utils](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) package provides some reusable functionalities for various purposes.\n"
msgstr ""
"unde $J$ este intensitatea cuplajului dintre două site-uri și $h$ este câmpul magnetic extern.\n"
"Pachetul [qiskit_addon_utils](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) oferă unele funcționalități reutilizabile pentru diverse scopuri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Its [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) module provides functions to generate Heisenberg-like Hamiltonians on a given connectivity graph.\n"
"This graph can be either a [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html) or a [CouplingMap](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap) making it easy to use in Qiskit-centric workflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Modulul său [qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.problem_generators.html) oferă funcții pentru generarea de Hamiltonieni de tip Heisenberg pe un graf de conectivitate dat.\n"
"Acest graf poate fi fie un [rustworkx.PyGraph](https://www.rustworkx.org/apiref/rustworkx.PyGraph.html), fie un [CouplingMap](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap), ceea ce îl face ușor de utilizat în fluxuri de lucru centrate pe Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following, we create a simple line of 10 qubits using the "
"`CouplingMap.from_line` method.\n"
msgstr ""
"În cele ce urmează, creăm o linie simplă de 10 Qubiți folosind metoda "
"`CouplingMap.from_line`.\n"

